# Template only. This file is committed to a PUBLIC repo: never put a real key here.
#
# To use it:
#   1. Copy this file to .env  (cp .env.example .env)
#   2. Put your key in .env    (.env is git-ignored, so it stays on your machine)
# In Claude cloud sessions, add ANTHROPIC_API_KEY in the environment settings instead.
#
# Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com -> API Keys -> Create Key (starts with sk-ant-api).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

